09:26.280 --> 09:27.480
In other words,

09:27.640 --> 09:29.580
all the configurations of,

09:29.580 --> 09:32.400
well, the X values in the combined data set,

09:33.260 --> 09:37.080
work them all out

09:37.080 --> 09:39.740
