20:46.060 --> 20:47.100
which ties

20:47.100 --> 20:47.580
with one of

20:47.580 --> 20:48.260
my scores.

20:49.120 --> 20:49.800
What we do

20:49.800 --> 20:50.280
in the case

20:50.280 --> 20:50.820
of ties

20:50.820 --> 20:52.000
is we

20:52.000 --> 20:52.460
