20:53.700 --> 20:54.060
so now

20:54.060 --> 20:54.580
both of

20:54.580 --> 20:55.340
these values

20:55.340 --> 20:56.040
have rank.

20:56.440 --> 20:56.800
Well,

20:57.140 --> 20:57.420
they would

20:57.420 --> 20:57.820
have rank

20:57.820 --> 20:58.240
four and

20:58.240 --> 20:58.900
five,

20:59.160 --> 20:59.980
they're tied,

21:00.300 --> 21:00.980
so we give

21:00.980 --> 21:01.540
each one

21:01.540 --> 21:02.020
rank

21:02.020 --> 21:03.060
four and

21:03.060 --> 21:03.680
a half,

21:04.440 --> 21:05.240
and proceed

21:05.240 --> 21:05.980
as before.

21:06.600 --> 21:07.120
We proceed

21:07.120 --> 21:07.720
as before,

21:07.960 --> 21:08.820
mindful that

21:08.820 --> 21:10.040
the rankings

21:10.040 --> 21:10.960
