21:13.580 --> 21:13.900
of the

21:13.900 --> 21:14.460
distribution

21:14.460 --> 21:15.000
of the

21:15.000 --> 21:15.660
test statistic,

21:16.180 --> 21:16.920
but it does

21:16.920 --> 21:17.360
