21:29.800 --> 21:30.180
are lots

21:30.180 --> 21:30.680
of ties,

21:31.500 --> 21:32.080
and that's

21:32.080 --> 21:32.500
something to

21:32.500 --> 21:32.860
be born

21:32.860 --> 21:33.360
in mind.

21:34.140 --> 21:34.720
The way

21:34.720 --> 21:35.140
we've

21:35.140 --> 21:36.480
conducted the

21:36.480 --> 21:37.140
test here

21:37.140 --> 21:39.480
is by

21:39.480 --> 21:40.320
considering all

21:40.320 --> 21:41.140
the possibilities

21:41.140 --> 21:44.440
and enumerating

21:44.440 --> 21:45.180
