21:52.160 --> 21:52.700
test,

21:53.420 --> 21:54.100
and more

21:54.100 --> 21:54.640
on that

21:54.640 --> 21:55.780
later.

21:57.980 --> 21:58.500
So,

21:58.560 --> 21:58.960
that's the

21:58.960 --> 21:59.320
bank sum

21:59.320 --> 21:59.700
test,

21:59.900 --> 22:00.520
I hope

22:00.520 --> 22:00.780
you've

22:00.780 --> 22:01.340
